namespace DreamShader.IRBuilder.Substrate

IRBuilderSubstrateBuilderGone {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRBuilderSubstrate.cpp
    src   "'{0}' is not the Substrate value being built any more when a loop comes round to '{0}.{1}': an earlier trip assigned it. Declare the value inside the loop, or finish it before the loop."
    text  "循环绕回到 '{0}.{1}' 时，'{0}' 已经不再是那个正在构建的 Substrate 值了：前一趟循环给它整体赋过值。请把该值声明在循环内部，或者在循环之前把它写完。"
    state machine
}

IRBuilderSubstrateBuilderUnset {
    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRBuilderSubstrate.cpp
    src   "'{0}.{1}' has no value where it is read: the line that writes it did not run on the way here. Give it a value on every path first."
    text  "'{0}.{1}' 在读取处没有值：到这里的路径上，写它的那一行没有执行。请先在每条路径上都给它一个值。"
    state machine
}

