    at    Source/DreamShaderLang/Private/IR/IRBuilderSubstrate.cpp
    src   "This material drives FrontMaterial and says 'Substrate = Native', and Substrate is off in this project; the engine could not compile the asset. Turn Substrate on, or write 'Substrate = Bridge' and the legacy attributes."
